  "implementation": [
    "One finite 23-output composition binds HTTP94 setup, nine-writer provisioning, plan/handoff, one native HTTP attempt and public/private retention. Frozen predecessors remain unchanged.",
    "Broker startup GET and AF_UNIX listener are joined to the same independently observed broker PID/start epoch, with pidfd and listening-inode ownership checks. No connection to the broker socket is used as a witness.",
    "Readiness child is closed and reaped before the effect sink opens. Partial observations survive cleanup failure; incomplete custody preserves the exact fixture.",
    "Private host semantic replay uses the exact six staged dependencies plus generated consumers, with temporary unique dataclass registrations and unchanged original package globals.",
    "Native worker/broker timestamps and real HTTP evidence are retained; no generic callback timestamps, fake effects or automatic retries."
  ],
  "remaining": [
    "Source-bound finite benign task inputs and reviewed one-HTTP development contract before capture preparation",
    "One serialized guarded HTTP94 capture, actual same-process listener evidence, independent replay and verified cleanup/prior VM state restoration",
    "Remaining admission, RUN/sensor-health and paired workload adapters; full verifier inventory then final freeze/acceptance"
  ],
